      "name": "Pending Transactions",
      "description": {
        "content": "Pending Transactions are potential future additions and removals of money from your bank account. They impact your available balance, but not your current balance. To learn more, see [Transactions and Transfers](/documentation/transactions-transfers).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
